## URGENT FLAG (filed separately)

A subagent's line in `changes_muse_20261014-2020.jsonl` (Group 1 verify homework, already in incoming) wrongly "corrected" AU.KM.37's catalogs to Numista N#1003 / KM#66. N#1003 is the **1966 20 cents platypus** — a different coin. AU.KM.37 is the **1943-S George VI threepence**; KM#37 is correct (confirmed: NGC price guide "Australia Threepence KM 37"; heritcoin Krause KM#37 for 1944-S). I filed `changes_muse_20261015-0332-BLOCK-AUKM37.jsonl` to block that line. **Please reject the AU.KM.37 catalogs line from the 2020 file.**

